%feature("docstring") casadi::DaeBuilder::beq "

Get the binding equation for a variable.

The right-hand side of the explicit equation defining the variable; a
variable without binding equation is an error.



::

  >>> dae = DaeBuilder(\"m\")
  >>> x = dae.add(\"x\")
  >>> w = dae.add(\"w\")
  >>> dae.eq(w, sin(x))
  >>> dae.eq(dae.der(x), -w)
  >>> dae.beq(\"w\"), dae.beq(\"der(x)\")
