%feature("docstring") casadi::GenericExpressionCommon::rdivide "

Elementwise division: (x,y) -> x ./ y.

Elementwise quotient, not a linear solve; use solve or mldivide for that.
Shape rules as for plus. Division by zero follows IEEE arithmetic (inf or
nan), no error is raised. Structural zeros of ``x`` stay structural zeros;
dividing by a sparse ``y`` densifies.



::

  >>> rdivide(DM([1, 2]), 4)
  DM([0.25, 0.5])
  >>> DM([1, 2]) / DM([4, 8])
  DM([0.25, 0.25])
  >>> 1 / DM.eye(2)
  DM(
  [[1, inf],
   [inf, 1]])
  >>> DM.eye(2) / 2
  DM(
  [[0.5, 00],
   [00, 0.5]])
  





See also: mldivide, mrdivide, solve

