%feature("docstring") casadi::GenericExpressionCommon::eq "

Logical equal to: (x,y) -> x == y.

Elementwise comparison with 0/1 result, see lt: this is value equality of
the entries, not identity of expressions; use is_equal to test whether two
symbolic expressions are the same. For symbolic operands x == x with the
same node simplifies to 1. NaN is not equal to anything, including itself.



::

  >>> eq(DM([1, 2, 3]), 2)
  DM([0, 1, 0])
  >>> DM.eye(2) == DM([[1, 0], [0, 1]])
  DM(
  [[1, 1],
   [1, 1]])
  >>> x = SX.sym(\"x\")
  >>> x == x, x == SX.sym(\"x\")
