structurally zero wherever either operand is. The value of ``y`` in the
inactive branch does not propagate, so a NaN or inf there yields 0 rather
than NaN, and the derivatives are treated accordingly. This is the building
block of if_else; it is not exposed as a function in Python, use if_else(x,
y, 0) there.



See also: if_else

