%feature("docstring") casadi::GenericMatrixCommon::linspace "

Matlab's ``linspace`` command.

Returns the column vector [a, a + (b-a)/(nsteps-1), ..., b] with ``nsteps``
entries, the endpoints included. For nsteps == 1 the result is ``b``. When
``a`` and ``b`` are matrices, the ``nsteps`` intermediate matrices are
stacked vertically (vertcat). ``nsteps`` must be at least 1.



