Two-stage workflow: explore and configure a model (introspection, dynamic-
dimension binding) with GraphBuilder, then freeze it into an immutable,
evaluable Function.



::

  GraphBuilder b(\"model.onnx\");
  b.bind_dim(\"batch\", 4);
  Function f = b.create(\"net\");
  



