%feature("docstring") casadi::Linsol::nfact "

Numeric factorization of the linear system.

Factorizes the values of ``A`` (after sfact if not done yet), so that neig,
rank and the low-level solve can use the factorization. Raises an error when
the factorization fails with option \"regularity_check\" set; otherwise a
failure is only reported by solve.



::

  >>> A = DM([[3, 1], [1, 2]])
  >>> L = Linsol(\"L\", \"ldl\", A.sparsity())
  >>> L.nfact(A)
  >>> L.neig(A), L.rank(A)
  (0, 2)
  >>> L.nfact(DM([[-1, 0], [0, 1]]))
  >>> L.neig(DM([[-1, 0], [0, 1]]))
  1
  



Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_2pj

