%feature("docstring") casadi::Matrix< double >::heaviside "

Heaviside step function, elementwise.

H(x) = 0 for x < 0, 1/2 for x == 0 and 1 for x > 0, computed as (1 +
sign(x))/2. Structural zeros of a sparse input become 1/2. Not defined for
MX.



::

  >>> heaviside(DM([-1, 0, 1]))
  DM([0, 0.5, 1])
  >>> heaviside(SX.sym(\"x\"))
  SX(((1+sign(x))/2))
  





See also: ramp, rectangle, sign

