%feature("docstring") casadi::Matrix< double >::ldl_solve "

Solve A*x = b with the factors returned by ldl.



Parameters:
    b: Right-hand side, one column per system; a sparse ``b`` is densified
    D, LT, p: Output of ldl(A)



Returns:
    Dense solution with the shape of ``b``



::

  >>> A = DM([[4, 2], [2, 3]])
  >>> D, LT, p = ldl(A)
  >>> ldl_solve(DM([1, 2]), D, LT, p)
  DM([-0.125, 0.75])
  >>> solve(A, DM([1, 2]))
  DM([-0.125, 0.75])
  





