%feature("docstring") casadi::Matrix< double >::has_zeros "

Check if any structural nonzero is known to be numerically zero.

For SX only entries that are the constant 0 count. Use sparsify to remove
them.



::

  >>> DM([1, 0]).has_zeros(), DM([1, 2]).has_zeros(), DM(2, 2).has_zeros()
  (True, False, False)
  >>> x = SX.sym(\"x\")
  >>> vertcat(x, 0).has_zeros(), vertcat(x, x * 0).has_zeros()
  (True, True)
  





See also: sparsify, has_nz

Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_1a1

Doc source:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/matrix_decl.hpp#L2969
";

