%feature("docstring") casadi::Matrix< double >::get_elements "

Get all elements as a flat list in column-major order (Python: elements())

Like nonzeros, but structural zeros are included as 0, so the list has
numel() entries.



::

  >>> DM(Sparsity.diag(2)).elements()
  [1.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0]
  





See also: nonzeros, densify

Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_1a3

