%feature("docstring") casadi::Matrix< double >::is_dense "

Check if the matrix is dense, i.e. nnz() equals numel()

Based on the sparsity pattern only: stored numerical zeros still count as
nonzeros. Empty matrices are dense.



::

  >>> DM.zeros(2, 2).is_dense(), DM(2, 2).is_dense(), DM(0, 3).is_dense()
  (True, False, True)
  





See also: nnz, numel, densify

Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_1b0

Doc source:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/generic_matrix.hpp#L310
Implementation:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/generic_matrix.hpp#L310-L310
";

