%feature("docstring") casadi::Matrix< double >::is_triu "

Check if the matrix is upper triangular.

Decided on the sparsity pattern alone: all structural nonzeros must lie on
or above the diagonal. A dense matrix with numerical zeros below the
diagonal is not upper triangular. Also defined for non- square matrices.



::

  >>> DM(Sparsity.upper(3), 1).is_triu(), DM.zeros(2, 2).is_triu(), DM(2, 2).is_triu()
  (True, False, True)
  





See also: is_tril, triu, triu2symm

Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_1b6

Doc source:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/generic_matrix.hpp#L390
Implementation:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/generic_matrix.hpp#L390-L390
";

