%feature("docstring") casadi::Matrix< double >::set_precision "

Set the precision, field width and scientific flag used when printing
nonzeros.

Global settings per class (DM and SX each keep their own), applied by str(),
print() and the print_* methods. Defaults: precision 6, width 0, scientific
false.



::

  >>> DM.set_precision(3)
  >>> DM(1/3)
  DM(0.333)
  >>> DM.set_precision(6)
  >>> DM(1/3)
  DM(0.333333)
  





See also: get_precision

Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_2p6

