%feature("docstring") casadi::Matrix< double >::rng "

Seed the random number generator used by rand.

The generator is global to the class and is seeded from the clock at
startup; seeding it makes subsequent rand calls reproducible.



::

  >>> DM.rng(1); a = DM.rand(2, 2)
  >>> DM.rng(1); b = DM.rand(2, 2)
  >>> float(norm_inf(a - b))
  0.0
  





See also: rand

Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_2p7

