%feature("docstring") casadi::OptiAdvanced::return_status "

Get the return status of the last solve.

The plugin's \"return_status\" string (e.g. \"Solve_Succeeded\" or
\"Infeasible_Problem_Detected\" for Ipopt), or \"unknown\" when no solve has
