%feature("docstring") casadi::Sparsity::get_row "

Row index of every nonzero, in nonzero (column-major) order.

Length nnz(). Together with get_colind() this is the compressed column
storage of the pattern; together with get_col() it is the triplet form. In
the target languages this method is called row(), the same name as the
single-element accessor.



::

  >>> sp = Sparsity.triplet(3, 4, [0, 2, 1, 0], [0, 0, 2, 3])
  >>> DM(sp, 1)
  DM(
  [[1, 00, 00, 1],
   [00, 00, 1, 00],
   [1, 00, 00, 00]])
  >>> sp.row(), sp.colind(), sp.get_col()
  ([0, 2, 1, 0], [0, 2, 2, 3, 4], [0, 0, 2, 3])
  >>> Sparsity.dense(2, 2).row(), Sparsity(2, 2).colind()
  ([0, 1, 0, 1], [0, 0, 0])
  >>> Sparsity(0, 2).colind(), Sparsity(2, 0).colind()
  ([0, 0, 0], [0])
  





