The number of columns must match, otherwise an error is raised; a 0-by-0
pattern on either side is ignored. Equivalent to rebinding to vertcat(self,
sp); only cheap when both are column vectors.



::

  >>> sp = Sparsity.dense(2, 2); sp.append(Sparsity.diag(2)); print(DM(sp, 1))
