%feature("docstring") casadi::Sparsity::spy_matlab "

Write a MATLAB/Octave script that builds the pattern as a sparse matrix and
calls spy.

The file is overwritten. The script defines a sparse matrix A of ones with
this pattern (see export_code) and ends with spy(A).



Parameters:
