Returns:
    Column vector of the same type as the arguments



::

  >>> veccat(DM([[1, 2], [3, 4]]), 5)
  DM([1, 3, 2, 4, 5])
  >>> veccat(MX.sym(\"x\", 2, 2), MX.sym(\"y\", 1, 3))
