%feature("docstring") casadi::SparsityInterfaceCommon::sum "

Sum all elements.

Returns a 1-by-1 matrix with the sum of all elements, combining sum1 and
sum2. An empty matrix sums to a structural zero. The Python function also
accepts an axis argument: sum(x, 0) is sum1(x) and sum(x, 1) is sum2(x).



