%feature("docstring") casadi::IndexReduction::kron_contract "

Kronecker contraction, the adjoint of kron.

Contracts a matrix ``m`` whose dimensions are multiples of those of ``x``
(as produced by kron) against ``x``. With mB-by-nB the shape of ``x`` and
blocks M[i*mB+r, j*nB+s] of ``m:``



- ``inner`` true: Y[i, j] = sum over (r, s) of M[i*mB+r, j*nB+s] * X[r, s]
- ``inner`` false: Y[r, s] = sum over (i, j) of X[i, j] * M[i*mB+r, j*nB+s]



Closes the AD algebra of kron under arbitrary-order differentiation. A shape
that is not a multiple raises an error.



::

  >>> M = MX.sym(\"M\", 4, 4)
  >>> X = MX.sym(\"X\", 2, 2)
  >>> f = Function(\"f\", [M, X], [kron_contract(M, X, True), kron_contract(M, X, False)])
  >>> f(DM(np.arange(16).reshape(4, 4)), DM.eye(2))
  (DM(
  [[5, 9],
   [21, 25]]), DM(
  [[10, 12],
   [18, 20]]))
  





See also: kron

Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_2ho

Doc source:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/mx.hpp#L3716
Implementation:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/mx.hpp#L3716-L3718 ";

