%feature("docstring") casadi::IndexReduction::rootfinder_options "

Get all options of a rootfinder plugin.

Returns the names of the plugin-specific options only; the options shared by
all plugins (e.g. \"linear_solver\", \"error_on_fail\") are not included.
Raises an error for an unknown plugin.



::

  >>> opts = rootfinder_options(\"newton\")
  >>> \"max_iter\" in opts, \"abstol\" in opts, \"linear_solver\" in opts
  (True, True, False)
  





See also: rootfinder_option_type, rootfinder_option_info

Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_1u4

Doc source:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/rootfinder.hpp#L87
Implementation:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/rootfinder.cpp#L87-L89
";

