%feature("docstring") casadi::IndexReduction::load_rootfinder "

Explicitly load a rootfinder plugin.

Normally plugins are loaded on first use; this raises an error when the
plugin cannot be found.



::

  >>> try:
  ...     load_rootfinder(\"no_such_plugin\")
  ... except RuntimeError as e:
  ...     print(\"no_such_plugin\" in str(e))
  True
  



